  <h2 id="status">A brand-new startup, built in India</h2>
  <p>
    avaTOK is built in India by a small founding team working from Dehradun. We build AI-first
    digital products for everyday life, and right now we are doing the earliest part of that work:
    turning an idea into a product and testing it with people we invite.
  </p>
